    {
      "id": "Pl5CCW_4NxEEGKK8hiXX_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 854.5274345483508,
      "y": 3016.1422529389274,
      "width": 511.50358637415,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1806753591,
      "version": 266,
      "versionNonce": 1881532997,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791022746485,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TERSOLDER PERMANEN DI PCB (25×20mm):\n\n├── ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8\n├── LMP91000MA/NOPB (TSSOP-14)\n├── ADS1115 (MSOP-10 bare chip)\n├── LP5907MFX-3.3 (SOT-23-5)\n├── AMS1117-3.3 (SOT-223)\n├── TP4056 + DW01A (bare chips SOT-23-6) ←\nBUKAN module breakout!\n├── PRTR5V0U2X (SOT-363)\n├── WS2812B Mini (3535)\n├── Ferrite Bead 600Ω (0805)\n├── Semua Resistor & Kapasitor (0805)\n├── Pin Header Female 8-pin (cartridge socket)\n├── JST-PH 2.0 Connector (battery socket)\n└── USB-C Receptacle\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TERSOLDER PERMANEN DI PCB (25×20mm):\n\n├── ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8\n├── LMP91000MA/NOPB (TSSOP-14)\n├── ADS1115 (MSOP-10 bare chip)\n├── LP5907MFX-3.3 (SOT-23-5)\n├── AMS1117-3.3 (SOT-223)\n├── TP4056 + DW01A (bare chips SOT-23-6) ← BUKAN module breakout!\n├── PRTR5V0U2X (SOT-363)\n├── WS2812B Mini (3535)\n├── Ferrite Bead 600Ω (0805)\n├── Semua Resistor & Kapasitor (0805)\n├── Pin Header Female 8-pin (cartridge socket)\n├── JST-PH 2.0 Connector (battery socket)\n└── USB-C Receptacle\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wfwVJn9Fvv7isxaYhF7Mx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1387.0221385699379,
      "y": 2989.6262938046607,
      "width": 690.8754386017704,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 562052631,
      "version": 430,
      "versionNonce": 2100856971,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791022746485,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nTERHUBUNG VIA KABEL/KONEKTOR:\n├── Li-Po 2000mAh → kabel JST-PH 2.0 → soket di PCB\n└── OLED SSD1306 → FPC ribbon cable → header di PCB\n\n\nTIDAK ADA HUBUNGAN ELEKTRIK LANGSUNG KE PCB:\n\n├── Tactile Switches → tersolder di PCB TAPI posisinya ditentukan\ncasing\n├── Cartridge → masuk ke pin header di PCB, tapi bersifat\ndisposable/ganti-ganti\n└── Casing 3D Print → hanya mekanis, tidak ada koneksi elektrik",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nTERHUBUNG VIA KABEL/KONEKTOR:\n├── Li-Po 2000mAh → kabel JST-PH 2.0 → soket di PCB\n└── OLED SSD1306 → FPC ribbon cable → header di PCB\n\n\nTIDAK ADA HUBUNGAN ELEKTRIK LANGSUNG KE PCB:\n\n├── Tactile Switches → tersolder di PCB TAPI posisinya ditentukan casing\n├── Cartridge → masuk ke pin header di PCB, tapi bersifat disposable/ganti-ganti\n└── Casing 3D Print → hanya mekanis, tidak ada koneksi elektrik",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
