      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Frontend: Next.js 14\nBackend: Supabase\n\nFitur:\n• Dashboard real-time\n  (WebSocket Realtime)\n• Riwayat pengukuran\n• Grafik tren gula darah\n\nKeamanan:\n• Auth per pengguna\n• Row Level Security\n• Data terenkripsi\n\nAkses:\nWeb browser (HP/Laptop)",
      "fontSize": 15.894442332143084,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Frontend: Next.js 14\nBackend: Supabase\n\nFitur:\n• Dashboard real-time\n  (WebSocket Realtime)\n• Riwayat pengukuran\n• Grafik tren gula darah\n\nKeamanan:\n• Auth per pengguna\n• Row Level Security\n• Data terenkripsi\n\nAkses:\nWeb browser (HP/Laptop)",
