      "text": "Mikrokontroler\nUtama\n\nFungsi:\n• Kontrol DAC\n• Baca ADS1115\n  (I2C)\n• Timer viskositas\n  (GPIO interrupt)\n• Inferensi SVM\n  TinyML\n• Tampilkan OLED\n• Kirim WiFi\n  (JSON)\n\nClock: 240 MHz\nRAM: 512KB\nFlash: 4MB",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mikrokontroler\nUtama\n\nFungsi:\n• Kontrol DAC\n• Baca ADS1115\n  (I2C)\n• Timer viskositas\n  (GPIO interrupt)\n• Inferensi SVM\n  TinyML\n• Tampilkan OLED\n• Kirim WiFi\n  (JSON)\n\nClock: 240 MHz\nRAM: 512KB\nFlash: 4MB",
