      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783513800976,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kondisi DIABETES (hiperglikemia):",
      "fontSize": 15.192929041335393,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kondisi DIABETES (hiperglikemia):",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bAo",
      "autoResize": true,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Y0DEQjGBdu34UwCy_LrsI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3365.7041196433365,
      "y": 470.8045602937418,
      "width": 392.253804339932,
      "height": 143.64223820898917,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7f1d1d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2115909985,
      "version": 214,
      "versionNonce": 940340673,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783513800976,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Gula darah tinggi → glukosa saliva ↑\n• Bakteri oral memfermentasikan\n  glukosa berlebih → asam laktat ↑\n• Kapasitas buffer bikarbonat menurun\n  (hiposalivasi diabetik)\n• Hasil: pH saliva TURUN → lebih asam\n  (pH < 6,8 pada kondisi berat)\n• OCP IrOx bergeser ke nilai lebih\n  negatif (deteksi otomatis)",
      "fontSize": 15.192929041335393,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Gula darah tinggi → glukosa saliva ↑\n• Bakteri oral memfermentasikan\n  glukosa berlebih → asam laktat ↑\n• Kapasitas buffer bikarbonat menurun\n  (hiposalivasi diabetik)\n• Hasil: pH saliva TURUN → lebih asam\n  (pH < 6,8 pada kondisi berat)\n• OCP IrOx bergeser ke nilai lebih\n  negatif (deteksi otomatis)",
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "index": "bAp",
      "autoResize": true,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
