      "locked": false,
      "text": "Alur Perhitungan pH di ESP32-S3:",
      "fontSize": 15.192929041335393,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Alur Perhitungan pH di ESP32-S3:",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bAr",
      "autoResize": true,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1Pk3u3Wt7NU8kKg9AeYQS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3365.7041196433365,
      "y": 664.1691117289196,
      "width": 392.253804339932,
      "height": 187.83984996560125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0c4a6e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 792250625,
      "version": 214,
      "versionNonce": 70771041,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783513800976,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "① Baca V_OCP dari ADS1115 (mV)\n② Baca suhu T dari sensor NTC (°C)\n③ Hitung slope koreksi:\n   S(T) = −0,1984 × (T + 273,15)\n④ Hitung pH:\n   pH = (V_OCP − V_ref) / S(T)\n       + pH_ref\n   (V_ref dan pH_ref dari kalibrasi\n    buffer pH 6,8 atau 7,4)\n⑤ Output pH ke OLED & kirim ke\n   Web Platform via WiFi",
      "fontSize": 15.192929041335393,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "① Baca V_OCP dari ADS1115 (mV)\n② Baca suhu T dari sensor NTC (°C)\n③ Hitung slope koreksi:\n   S(T) = −0,1984 × (T + 273,15)\n④ Hitung pH:\n   pH = (V_OCP − V_ref) / S(T)\n       + pH_ref\n   (V_ref dan pH_ref dari kalibrasi\n    buffer pH 6,8 atau 7,4)\n⑤ Output pH ke OLED & kirim ke\n   Web Platform via WiFi",
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "index": "bAs",
      "autoResize": true,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uWEBO-hqpnfFeWkiulqXB",
