      "text": "150–240 subjek  |  3 kelas (50+/kelas)\nNormal (<100) / Pre-Diabetes (100–125)\n/ Diabetes (≥126 mg/dL kapiler)\nGlucometer ISO 15197:2013 = ground truth",
      "fontSize": 17.16861442316815,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
