      "text": "Input: [glucose_saliva, pH, viscosity]\nSVC (kernel RBF) → klasifikasi 3 kelas\nSVR (kernel RBF) → estimasi mg/dL\nGridSearchCV: optimasi C & gamma\nLibrary: scikit-learn (Python)",
