      "text": "TERSOLDER PERMANEN DI PCB (25×20mm):\n\n├── ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8\n├── LMP91000MA/NOPB (TSSOP-14)\n├── ADS1115 (MSOP-10 bare chip)\n├── LP5907MFX-3.3 (SOT-23-5)\n├── AMS1117-3.3 (SOT-223)\n├── TP4056 + DW01A (bare chips SOT-23-6) ←\nBUKAN module breakout!\n├── PRTR5V0U2X (SOT-363)\n├── WS2812B Mini (3535)\n├── Ferrite Bead 600Ω (0805)\n├── Semua Resistor & Kapasitor (0805)\n├── Pin Header Female 8-pin (cartridge socket)\n├── JST-PH 2.0 Connector (battery socket)\n└── USB-C Receptacle\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TERSOLDER PERMANEN DI PCB (25×20mm):\n\n├── ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8\n├── LMP91000MA/NOPB (TSSOP-14)\n├── ADS1115 (MSOP-10 bare chip)\n├── LP5907MFX-3.3 (SOT-23-5)\n├── AMS1117-3.3 (SOT-223)\n├── TP4056 + DW01A (bare chips SOT-23-6) ← BUKAN module breakout!\n├── PRTR5V0U2X (SOT-363)\n├── WS2812B Mini (3535)\n├── Ferrite Bead 600Ω (0805)\n├── Semua Resistor & Kapasitor (0805)\n├── Pin Header Female 8-pin (cartridge socket)\n├── JST-PH 2.0 Connector (battery socket)\n└── USB-C Receptacle\n",
